  "steps": [
    "Mash avocado with American cheese, lime juice, salt, pepper and garlic powder until smooth. Spread over tortilla.",
    "Chop pak choi. Fry pak choi in a little oil 1 minute. Add egg whites; spread out and cook 30 seconds.",
    "Transfer egg white mixture onto the avocado tortilla. Return tortilla to pan, filling-side down. Fold in half; press. Fry both sides 30 seconds."
